WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.377
VectorMapNet is the first end-to-end pipeline that
reads onboard camera and LiDAR and

00:00:05.457 --> 00:00:07.560
predicts a sparse set of polylines

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.871
the primitive planners actually use.

00:00:09.951 --> 00:00:13.980
It skips rasterization entirely and sets a new
state of the art.
